From: Thinh Phuc Nguyen <nguyenthinhphuc1901@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:05:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(oauth2): Add allowed algorithms to profile (#1639)

* feat(oauth2): Add allowed algorithms to profile

Let a subject-token validation profile list the JWT algorithms it
accepts instead of pinning one through a separate argument of
verify_subject_token_jwt. Native profiles keep their single configured
algorithm; external profiles default to RS256 and ES256 and can be
widened per issuer with with_allowed_algorithms.

The header alg is checked against the list before any key lookup. An
empty list, or one that contains an HMAC algorithm, is rejected as an
invalid profile.

Part of #1636.

SecurityImpact

Signed-off-by: Thinh Phuc Nguyen <nguyenthinhphuc1901@gmail.com>

* test(oauth2): Install crypto provider in HS256 test

Signed-off-by: Thinh Phuc Nguyen <nguyenthinhphuc1901@gmail.com>

